{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "PiCrawler \u2014 7.2-EPM whole-body chunks + Compass + Spinal CPG (Fractal JEPA Embodiment B)",
    "description": "Embodiment B \u2014 single whole-body MotorRepertoire/ActionDecoder over a 12-channel combined intent index (radix [5]*12).  Per-leg chunks (Embodiment A) crystallised uncoordinated patterns because each leg had its own dispatch decision against its own context; the whole-body variant forces coordination by construction \u2014 when a chunk fires it dispatches all 12 channels simultaneously.\n\nPipeline (vs per-leg Embodiment A):\n  - 1 PolicyChannelAggregator packs all 12 joint PolicyTokens into one combined index\n    (5^12 \u2248 244M discrete states; chunks library only stores observed sequences)\n  - 1 MotorRepertoire crystallises 12-channel chunks; motif source is sequence.motif.body\n    (seqgng_body re-tuned with larger min_insertion_error so it actually finds clusters)\n  - 1 ActionDecoder dispatches IntentToken with indices=[12 values] via radix-unpack on\n    the intent.override.body topic\n  - 12 Premotors each read indices[their_channel] (0..11)\n\nPer-leg EPMs and per-leg SeqGNGs retained for voter_0 fusion + telemetry.\nepm_compass + CPGOscillator + Phase 7.1 action-mode SeqGNG telemetry all preserved.\nJointSensorimotorBridge feeds per-leg EPM inputs unchanged.\n\nPair with picrawler_walk_from_bootstrap.json curriculum to preload baseline standing\ncompetence, then let CPG + whole-body chunks shape coordinated locomotion.",
    "env_target": "picrawler",
    "phase_tag": "v6.17b + 7.2-EPM wbchunks + compass + CPG",
    "derived_from_manifest": true,
    "episode_length": 6000,
    "mc_episode_period": 1500,
    "stability_gain": 0.05,
    "stability_y_norm": 0.5,
    "stability_speed": 0.05,
    "reward_shape": "trapezoid",
    "target_height": 0.085,
    "height_penalty_grace": 0.02,
    "height_penalty_scale": 0.03,
    "height_penalty_gain": 0.05,
    "leg_symmetry": "lr_pairs"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "runtime": {
    "thread_pool": "per_instance",
    "num_threads": 0
  },
